window.products.push({"id":907124,"name":"Notohibako Wooden Home Decor Japanese Scene Premium Collection (Asakusa) [ Japan Import ] Made in Japan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":125.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713kxmrt4PL._AC_SL1416_.jpg","description":"SPECIFICATION Approximate Size：W6.77\"×D1.7\"×H5.7\". Made with natural wood and acrylic, and made in Kanazawa, Japan. You can enjoy the texture, fragrance, and warmth of the wood and you can use it as a decoration in the house. NIPPON SCENERY We designed traditional Japanese scenery on our trinkets. Looking at these trinkets provides a sense of being in Japan, and makes it easy to appreciate some of the beauty that Japan has to offer. If you have been to Japan, you can remember the trip of Japan seeing our trinket! NOTOHIBAKO This Notohibako consists of six layers of thinly sliced wood and an acrylic board. There is an acrylic board piled on 6 thin wooden boards. Because this product consists of six layers of piled up sliced wood, the depth and sense of realism that can’t be sensed in pictures can be felt by seeing Notohibako! ASAKUSA Asakusa is a famous sightseeing spot in Tokyo. Kaminari-mon gate is a landmark(symbol) of Asakusa. It is famous for its huge red lantern. Two big statues, Fujin and Raijin, stand on the sides of the gate. It is always crowded with many people and it is always full of energy!  in our trinket you can enjoy Kaminari-mon gate with big red lantern and many people enjoying shopping in Asakusa, Japan! PERFECT GIFT This item is provided in a beautifully designed box. You can buy this trinket also as a gift for everyone .This elaborate and high quality trinket will become their favorite item. That will make a perfect gift or souvenir for your familly, friends, co-workers, or even yourself ! NOTOHIBA A forestation tree species distributed only Noto, Japan.You can enjoy a unique refreshing smell.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713kxmrt4PL._AC_SL1416_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Notohibako","source_asin":"B082VSNDFJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-907124","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082VSNDFJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082VSNDFJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
