window.products.push({"id":907172,"name":"Kachiho Cartoon Blankets for Adults Blankets for Boys Lightweight Throw Blanket for Boys and Girls Plush Blanket Cozy Blanket for Couch Sofa Bed Home ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ycoHJ-NhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Anime Cartoon Blanket Throws Soft Plush Warm Flannel Blanket Super Soft Micro Flannel Fleece Bedding Blankets Anime blanket is 3D full width printing, single side printing, made of anti pilling flannel. Our soft fluffy blankets regulate your body temperature so you don't sweat or get too hot. They are great for the bed and naps on the couch. Our cartoon blankets can be used in all seasons. It can be used as an air-conditioning blanket or to keep warm. Waiting for your needs anytime, anywhere. Throw blankets for bed can be used as a gift for relatives and friends, children, couples, colleagues, elders, etc. Anime blankets are a good choice as birthday gifts and teen Christmas gifts. This will be a very pleasant gift. Throw Blanket is used widely in everyday life A desirable blanket would perfect your whole day once you cuddle yourself in softness and warmth at the end of a day. Purposefully light weight to meet your traveling needs. Stow soft plush warm flannel blanket away in your backpack or luggage for ultimate comfort in a car, bus or plane. Perfect for snuggling with family while enjoying a hot cup of coffee or hot cocoa and watching television. Special Note: 1) Please Check The Size Chart Carefully Before Purchasing This Product. If You Are Not Sure About The Size, Please Email Us. 2) Please Allow A Manual Measurement Error Of 2-3 Cm. 3) The Details And Patterns Of This Blanket May Be Slightly Different. 4) After Receiving The Goods, It Is Recommended To Wash Them In Cold Water And Dry Them Vertically. Avoid Prolonged Exposure To The Sun.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ycoHJ-NhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kachiho","source_asin":"B0BCG82CPS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-907172","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCG82CPS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCG82CPS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":907173,"name":"Southern Tide Home Printed Skipjack Cotton Sheet Blue Topaz, Full","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.76,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Hcvcazs9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We’re all about the CLASSIC AMERICAN LIFESTYLE: road trips across the country, quality time with our four-legged best friend, and low country boils on the coast. We have an affinity for all things BLUE, but we still live a COLORFUL life. From our wardrobe to our home, we don’t shy away from making a statement. Whether we’re decked out for a special occasion or suited up for a dip in the ocean, WE’RE ALWAYS UP FOR A GOOD TIME. WE LIVE FOR THE WATER: whether it’s fishing on the river, soaking up the rays by the sea, or cruising on the lake; WE’RE ALWAYS GAME. To us, the South is more than just a location, IT’S A STATE OF MIND. And we always bring a piece of the South wherever we go. WE ARE SOUTHERN TIDE","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Hcvcazs9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Martex","source_asin":"B00EV5D5V6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-907173","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EV5D5V6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EV5D5V6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
