window.products.push({"id":907176,"name":"Recalled Item: Vornado EH1-0014-01 VortexHeat Heater (Whitestone)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"Product Description Cut down on costly heating bills. The VortexHeat heater will maintain your desired room temperature especially during the chilly winter months. It generates and circulates heat for overall warmth throughout the entire room. Heater features an automatic shutoff element in the event it should tip over and it never exceeds a maximum 130° exit-air temperature. The compact size and angled dual-air inlets allow closer placement to walls and keeps the unit safely out of the way. Wipes clean with warm soapy cloth. Made in USA. 11-13/16Hx9-13/16Wx11-5/16L\". 6 lbs. Amazon.com This powerful, compact heater will warm a 10-foot-square room in about 15 minutes and then continuously maintain it at the selected temperature by throttling back its heat and fan. That eliminates annoying on-and-off, hot-and-cold cycles. The heater can be operated manually, also, with high and low heat and fan options as well as the automatic system connected to the infinitely variable thermostat. With the thermostat turned off, the heater converts to a two-speed fan. Non-glowing heat elements and tip-over shutoff provide safety, the durable, cool-touch plastic cabinet measures just 12-1/2 by 11-1/2 by 9-1/2 inches, and the heater operates at either 750 watts (on low) or 1500 watts (on high). It carries a 1-year warranty against defects. --Fred Brack Manufacturer's Notice The U.S. Consumer Product Safety Commission announces the following recall in voluntary cooperation with the firm below. Consumers should stop using recalled products immediately unless otherwise instructed. Name of product: Portable electric whole room heaters. Units: 1 million. Manufacturer: Vornado Air Circulation Systems Inc., of Andover, Kan. Problem: A faulty electrical connection can cause the heater to overheat and stop working, posing a fire hazard to consumers. Incidents/Injuries: Vornado has received 24 reports of heater fires, though no injuries have been reported. Description: The recalled portable electric whole room heaters are designed for indoor use and have model numbers 180VH., VH., Intellitemp., EVH., and DVH.. The model numbers are located on the bottom of each unit. Each heater is about 11 > inches long, 9 = inches wide, and about 12 inches tall; weighs about 6 lbs.; and has the Vornado name and symbol on the front. Sold at: Retailers and distributors nationwide, as well as Vornados Web site, sold the heaters from July 1991 through January 2004 for between $50 and $120. Assembled in: United States. Manufacturer Remedy Information Remedy: Consumers should stop using the recalled heaters immediately and contact Vornado to arrange for shipping and a repair, free of charge. Consumer Contact: Contact Vornado at (888) 221-5431 between 8 a.m. and 5 p.m. CT Monday through Friday or log on to the company's website at www.vornado.com See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon marketplace","source_asin":"B000050B5S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-907176","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000050B5S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000050B5S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
