window.products.push({"id":907182,"name":"TumblerDown | Wine Tumbler Glass Stainless Steel Double Wall, Insulated 12oz Stemless 2 Pack Set With Lid, Unbreakable Wine Glasses. BONUS GIFT INSIDE","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yP0Vs+IkL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Sometimes regular crystal glasses just aren’t the most elegant way to drink your wine. Every wine-lover wishes they could drink their wine anywhere, but bringing around those clear, delicate glasses just isn’t the most practical option. You could be enjoying a perfect day out at the beach relaxing with your favorite red, but all you have are disposable cups, which easily spill, and even affect the taste of your wine.  Bring your wine on all your vacations, out on the patio with friends, and pretty much anywhere without any risk of breaking your glass (and saying goodbye to your beloved cabernet). Enjoy your refreshments and keep your previous wine safe with our Metal Tumbler Wine Glasses! Built with a double wall, vacuum insulating wall that keeps your drinks fresh and cold (and hot, for those cozy nights in bed), our tumblers are must-have accessories for your kitchen. Enjoy your wine outdoors or while partying with friends without ever risking any broken glasses. This short, round, and simple tumbler also has a leak-resistant lid that seals your drinks in, with a slide-style opening so you can take a swig or sip from a straw.  Here are a few more reasons to love our portable wine thermos:  ✅ Set includes 2 x 12 oz capacity glasses  ✅ High-quality stainless steel resistant to rust and corrosion  ✅ Personalized Christmas gifts for your friends and loved ones  ✅ Bonus gift: cozy “Bring Me Wine” wine socks  ✅ Available in Shiny White and Rose Gold colors  ✅ Wide opening and dishwasher-safe for quick and easy cleaning  ✅ 100% money back guarantee Say cheers to drinking your wine in class and convenience! Add the Tumbler Down Wine Tumbler Glasses to your cart NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yP0Vs+IkL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tumbler Down","source_asin":"B07D8YMBWZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-907182","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D8YMBWZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D8YMBWZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
