window.products.push({"id":907227,"name":"Fantasia Boxed Collection: Natural Gemstone Collection in Presentation Case - Set #1 - Jewels in The Rough","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QrH2cwThL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"The Natural Gemstone Collection is the first in a series of rock, gemstone, fossil, and mineral sets from Fantasia Mining. This series is perfect to introduce childern to the joys of rock collecting and to get them excited about these natural wonders of the world. These sets have been used in pre-K, elementary, secondary and home schooling classrooms. They allow the teacher to interact with students in a fun and entertaining manner by letting the students have a hands on experience with real earth mined specimens instead of just viewing a picture in a book. The sets in this series aren't only for the classroom and aspiring geologists of all ages will enjoy the unique completely natural specimens received.The Natural Gemstone Collection you are ordering comes in a 7\" x 3.5\" clear plastic collectors box and contains 21 different types of natural rough gemstone specimens. Each individual specimen measures around 1/4\" to 3/4\" and is attached to the included identification card. On the back of the identification card is a description of each of the gemstones, their MOH's hardness value, and some of the locations the gemstones can be found in the world.This set includes the following natural specimens: Turquoise, Citrine, Agate, Tiger Eye, Amazonite, Fluorite, Peridot, Beryl, Jasper, Amethyst, Crystal Quartz, Garnet, Sodalite, Carnelian, Obsidian, Azurite, Rhodonite, Chrysocolla, Moonstone, Alabaster and Black Onyx. This is the authentic Fanatsia Mining Natural Gemstone Set which is proudly made in the USA - Manufacturer's Part Number JEWEL-H32. Contains small parts and is recommended for children 8 and up.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QrH2cwThL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fantasia","source_asin":"B016BAX18A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-907227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016BAX18A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016BAX18A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
