window.products.push({"id":907823,"name":"Meat Injectors for Smoking • Marinade Injector Creates Tender Meat & Poultry Flavors • Complete w/ 3 Premium Syringe Needles for Chunky & Liquid Marin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91m3zIISqtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ THE SECRET TO UNLOCKING MORE FLAVOR - As grill enthusiasts, we know there's little worse than disappointing the palate with dry, bland food. Soaking meat or poultry in marinade doesn't always deliver the best result as the acids and enzymes fail to permeate the center of thick cuts. The KITCHEN LABS CO. Flavor Infuser Kit offers an ideal solution by taking your meat beyond surface flavoring. ✅ HEAVY DUTY HIGH-QUALITY CONSTRUCTION - Made from high-grade 304 stainless steel that won't bend or break easily, the KITCHEN LABS CO. Flavor Infuser's heavy-duty construction offers full control over the speed and destination of your marinade. The kit includes 3 premium marinade needles sharp enough to puncture the toughest cuts of meat and poultry. It also includes a Flavor Infuser 2 ounce reservoir, a Flavor Saver baster brush and an EVA Travel Case for those on-the-go get-togethers. ✅ FUNCTIONAL DESIGN DELIVERS MAX FLAVOR - It's a process to create appetizing dishes and it begins long before meat hits the grill. THE ULTIMATE FLAVOR SOLUTION KIT delivers an explosion of tender flavorings through deep penetration and even marinade distribution. Couple the Flavor Infuser with the Flavor Saver Brush to capture leftover marinade and you are good to go! ✅ GREAT FLAVOR WITHOUT THE HASSLE - Grilling is a way of life, which is why there's no better time to fire up the grill than when friends and family visit. THE ULTIMATE FLAVOR SOLUTION KIT eliminates lengthy marinade soaking times so you can serve great-tasting, juicy meats without much preparation or hassle. As a bonus, the injector is easy to disassemble and dishwasher-safe, making cleanup a cinch. FREE BBQETO EBOOK INCLUDED! Get next-level Keto-Friendly Marinade recipes and MORE! ✅ LOOK NO FURTHER - The Perfect Gadget to add to your armory of BBQ accessories! With a professional design, The ULTIMATE FLAVOR SOLUTION KIT is a great gift for ALL occasions! Protected by our manufacturers 30-day 'no questions asked' money back guarantee, you have nothing to lose!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91m3zIISqtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Charred Grate","source_asin":"B07G3D846Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-907823","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G3D846Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G3D846Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
