window.products.push({"id":907829,"name":"JOYKI Bathroom Over The Toilet Storage Shelf,2-Tier Bathroom Storage Shelf Organizer with Adhesive Base and Hooks,Anti-Tilt No Drilling Wall Mounting ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JTiC1+x+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Non-Slip Wall Mounted Design】--This simple and pretty Over Toilet Storage Shelf could hold some essential toiletries without.There are two small \"legs\" on the back of the shelf, which are installed behind the toilet wall shelf to prevent the shelf from sliding forward, cleverly making up for the gap between toilet and wall. Adhesive bases are provided for double safeguard, which can be very stably fixed on the toilet tank. 【Double-Layer Space Saving Design】-- The double-layer structure of toilet rack effectively utilizes the space above the toilet,and items of different heights can be placed on each floor,The Bathroom Storage Shelf Over the Toilet Space Saver Rack is suitable for all types of toilets. The distance between the toilet and the shelf is more than 2 inches, which will not affect the normal use of the toilet. 【Good Mesh Grid Design】 --Bathroom storage cabinet size:12.2 inch L, 6 inch W, 14 inch H,cabinet is characterized by a solid iron body and an anti-rust coated surface, satisfying the relatively humid bathroom,The mesh grid design allows air circulation and reduces dust build-up and dry easily, ensures breathable and no odor and no more stagnant water,The anti-tilt bathroom toilet storage can bear a weight of about 11 pounds and is not easily deformed. 【Easy to Assembly and Durable Material】--You can use the assembly tools we provide, follow the steps of the assembly manual, you can easily assemble the toilet racks, and we offer two small hooks,which can be used to hang the bathroom accessories for hanging rings, such as use to hang the shower ball or brush,The Toilet Storage Shelf is adopt by a solid iron body and an anti-rust coated surface, which is durable and environmentally friendly. 【Good After-Sales Service】--Good bathroom environment brings you a good mood!If you have any questions during the product installation process, please contact our after-sale team via amazon, we will try our best to help you as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JTiC1+x+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOYKI","source_asin":"B09CYNVXHF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-907829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CYNVXHF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CYNVXHF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
