window.products.push({"id":907963,"name":"5 Core 5.3Qt Asian Rice Cooker Digital Programmable 15-in-1 Ergonomic Large soft Touch push button Electric Multi Cooker, Steamer Pot, Warmer 11 Cups ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":58.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bM1dg8+sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ Multi-Functional Use - With the help of your electric rice cooker, you can prepare everything from a filling jambalaya, steamed, vegetables, rice, decadent cake, Stew Pot, Steamer, Saute, and Yoghurt. The options are as limitless as your imagination. ✅ User-Friendly Programming - With this multicooker you get 7 different digital features that are simple to operate, and an automated “Keep Warm” mode after cooking is complete. This rice cooker has an ergonomic large soft-touch push button that is user-friendly, allowing you to set the cooking by simply pressing a button. The 24-hour delay timer and auto-keep-warm feature make it versatile for meal planning. ✅ 5.3Qt / 20 Cup Ultra Capacity – This Japanese rice cooker has a capacity of 5.3 quarts/20 cups (cooked) and 10 Cups uncooked, producing up to 20 cups of cooked aromatic rice, 3-6 pounds of meat, or a whole chicken. Ideal for groups, families, or other outdoor activities. ✅ Upgraded Inner Pot - 5Core brings you nothing but the best Asian rice cooker in the market which is not only Nutritious but also 100% toxic-free because of its 8x Bonded Granite nonstick inner pot. This Rice cooker is completely dishwasher safe, 100% toxic-free, and more durable than ceramic and conventional pots. ✅ High Safety - Rice, stew, soup, chili, and other foods can be prepared in the 5Core multicooker rather than on the stovetop or in another electric pressure cooker. When you open the stove, the cool touch handle guarantees your safety. Along with this spectacular rice steamer, we also provide a nonstick inner pot, steamer tray, rice measurement cup, and serving spatula. ✅ Easy to clean - The inside pot of the stainless steel Japanese rice cooker is incredibly easy to clean thanks to the non-stick coating. The dishwasher can be used to clean both the inner pot and all of the cooker's accessories. ✅ Nutritious & Delicious - You may save time without compromising quality by using the built-in Steam function to produce nutrient-rich meals above while rice, soup, or any other food simultaneously cooks below. This powerful rice steamer pot / rice cooker saves cooking time by more than 50% with a power of 900 Watt.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bM1dg8+sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"5 CORE","source_asin":"B09B1GSQGV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-907963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B1GSQGV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B1GSQGV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
